        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_6",
        on: "branch_if_6",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "who_slew_mordak",
            equals: "Arvith",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("We killed the necromancer on the battlefield! I struck the killing blow myself."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_7",
        on: "branch_if_7",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "who_slew_mordak",
            not_equals: "Arvith",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("We killed the necromancer on the battlefield! I saw the killing blow with my own eyes."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Come on, men. A stroll through such lovely green woods, what could be finer?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nil-Galion",
            text: _("You there! Halt and explain yourself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("We’re chasing after some men who kidnapped my brother!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nil-Galion",
            text: _("Those men caught their prisoner practicing necromancy; for your sake, I hope he was not your brother. Assume that the man they caught was your brother’s murderer, and rest assured that the grey mages will release all of the souls that their prisoner’s evil magic has bound to this world."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nil-Galion",
            text: _("We heard the sounds of battle three days ago, but the foul reek of death was unmistakable as the prisoner passed us; if your brother really is the prisoner then he is also a necromancer. Remember your brother as we all hope he was, and know that the prisoner’s fate will be revenge as dire as you could wish. Either way, nothing will be gained by your intrusion into our woods. Now advance no further, for we will defend our land."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("So much for those ghost stories, but even ghosts might have been more observant than these elves. Still, they will not stop me from freeing Baran!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mercenary",
            text: _("I am glad at least that we will not have to face ghosts. But those elves will have us at a disadvantage; our horses will not maneuver well in the trees."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Bah, just stay on the paths; our spearmen and bowmen can fight in the deeper woods. We have faced and won through greater perils than those amateurs can offer."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_sighted_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_seer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 3,
            hidden: "no",
            team_name: "evil",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_ai",
            side: 3,
            action: "add",
            path: "stage[main_loop].candidate_action[]",
            candidate: "ca_muff_toras_move",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "-1-19",
            ys: "-1-14",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I see them! There they are!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Muff Toras",
            x: 8,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Muff Toras",
            text: _("Curses! Had they been a few hours slower, I might have covered our tracks without arousing the elves’ suspicions. Still, no need for the disguise any more."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_12",
            type: "Revenant",
            side: 3,
            x: 8,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_12",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_13",
            type: "Revenant",
            side: 3,
            x: 8,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_13",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Well, elves? Now do you see who the necromancers are?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "messenger_elf",
            type: "Elvish Scout",
            side: 2,
            x: 15,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "messenger_elf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "messenger_elf",
            text: _("I heard sounds of battle, but did not expect to see this. I will inform the Council, they can work out who the necromancers are."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "messenger_elf",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 2,
            team_name: "elves,good",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "found_kidnappers",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Come on, men, let’s catch those kidnappers!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Muff%20Toras%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hah! You have captured me, but it will avail you nothing. I sent your precious brother the mage north with half my men a day since; he will be safely locked away in our master’s dungeons by now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("My blade is at your throat. Give us the way to my brother now, or I will spill your wretched blood on the ground."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "first_password_1",
            value: "Sithrak",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "first_password_2",
            value: "Eleben",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "first_password_3",
            value: "Jarlom",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "first_password_4",
            value: "Hamik",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_rand",
            variable: "first_password",
            values: "1..4",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "second_password_1",
            value: "Akranbral",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "second_password_2",
            value: "Drakanal",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "second_password_3",
            value: "Xaskanat",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "second_password_4",
            value: "Katklagad",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_rand",
            variable: "second_password",
            values: "1..4",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Three days ride to the northeast, in a deserted castle. The passwords to the guards are $first_password_$first_password and $second_password_$second_password|."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Bind him and take him with us. If he has played us false, he will die."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:heal_unit",
            amount: 1,
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Muff%20Toras%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Muff Toras",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mercenary",
            text: _("Captain, what are we riding into? I thought you wanted nothing to do with Baran any more, not since Toen Caric."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("I’m no longer sure. What’s between us remains, but knowing someone else has lain hands on him changes things. Mount up, and let’s get moving."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_12",
        on: "branch_if_12",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "found_kidnappers",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("These elves have delayed us too long, the kidnappers’ trail will have faded by now."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_13",
        on: "branch_if_13",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "found_kidnappers",
            not_equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("More elves are arriving; even if they believe me, the kidnappers’ trail is sure to fade before we can follow."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "time_over",
